# 7. Chapter lifecycle cho Editor

## Chapter status

```ts
type ChapterStatus =
  | "DRAFT"
  | "IN_PRODUCTION"
  | "READY_FOR_PUBLICATION"
  | "PUBLISHED"
  | "ARCHIVED";
```

## Editor actions theo Chapter status

### DRAFT

Editor có thể:

```txt
View chapter
Upload/manage pages nếu được phép
Create task nếu có pages
```

### IN_PRODUCTION

Editor có thể:

```txt
View pages
Open Page Studio
Create/manage task
Final review task submissions
Run readiness check
View blockers
```

### READY_FOR_PUBLICATION

Editor có thể:

```txt
Prepare/schedule publication
Review final chapter package
```

### PUBLISHED

Editor có thể:

```txt
View published status
View production history
Archive/unpublish nếu role/policy cho phép
```

Editor không nên có nút:

```txt
Approve chapter
```

Thay vào đó:

```txt
Mark ready for publication
```

và chỉ enable khi mọi required task đã `EDITOR_APPROVED`.

