  | "UPLOADING"
  | "PROCESSING"
  | "UPLOADED"
  | "PROCESSING_FAILED"
  | "IN_TASK"
  | "APPROVED"
  | "LOCKED";
```

## Page Studio gate

```ts
page.status === "UPLOADED" && Boolean(page.workingFileAssetId);
```

Editor có thể dùng Page Studio để:

```txt
View Working Image
View Original compare
