# 10. Task management cho Editor

## Task status

```ts
type TaskStatus =
  | "TODO"
  | "IN_PROGRESS"
  | "SUBMITTED"
  | "REVISION_REQUESTED"
  | "MANGAKA_APPROVED"
  | "EDITOR_APPROVED"
  | "REJECTED"
  | "CANCELLED";
```

## Editor có thể tạo task

Task fields:

```txt
targetType: PAGE | REGION
targetId
taskType
assignee
deadline
priority
instruction
```

Rule:

```txt
Assistant phải eligible
Assistant phải là SeriesMember ACTIVE
Không tạo duplicate active task cùng targetType + targetId + taskType
Không assign vào page/region locked hoặc deleted
```

## Duplicate active task guard

Active statuses:

```txt
TODO
IN_PROGRESS
SUBMITTED
REVISION_REQUESTED
MANGAKA_APPROVED
```

Finished statuses:

```txt
EDITOR_APPROVED
REJECTED
CANCELLED
```

Không tạo task mới cùng loại/cùng target nếu task cũ vẫn active.

