# 15. Publication flow cho Editor

## Publication status

```ts
type PublicationStatus =
  | "DRAFT"
  | "SCHEDULED"
  | "PUBLISHED"
  | "FAILED"
  | "CANCELLED";
```

Flow:

```txt
Chapter.status = READY_FOR_PUBLICATION
→ Editor/Admin create publication schedule
→ Publication.status = SCHEDULED
→ Publish job succeeds
→ Publication.status = PUBLISHED
→ Chapter.status = PUBLISHED
```

Không dùng `Chapter.status = SCHEDULED`.

