# 19. Delete / Archive rules cho Editor

## Series

Editor không hard delete Series đã vào workflow.

```txt
Proposal stage
→ Reject / Request revision / Forward to Board

Ongoing production
→ Archive / Request Board decision / Admin action

Published/ranking/payroll involved
→ Không hard delete từ Editor UI
```

## Chapter

```txt
DRAFT, chưa có page/task
→ Delete nếu policy cho phép

IN_PRODUCTION, có page nhưng chưa có task/submission
→ Delete with confirm nếu policy cho phép

Có task/submission/approved/published
→ Không hard delete
→ Archive / Unpublish / Admin flow
```

## Page

```txt
Chưa có task
→ Replace / Delete / Reorder allowed

Có active task
→ Block replace/delete/reorder

Có submission/approved/published
→ View-only hoặc admin recovery flow
```

## Region

```txt
Chưa có active task
→ Delete allowed with confirm

Có active task
→ Block delete
```

